{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match delivers fresh strategies, unpredictable encounters, and exciting skill combinations, creating a brand-new genre of online Action RPG unlike anything seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a vast forest, one powerful Boss faces off against five Hunters in a thrilling asymmetrical battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Boss burns down trees to gain vision and hunts heroes to unlock new skills and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Hunters fight monsters to level up, choose from random skills, and form parties with other heroes they encounter along the way all while avoiding the looming threat of a dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose to become a Swordmaster, Archer, or Mage, each with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When time runs out, the final Raid Battle begins: 1 Boss vs 5 Heroes in an epic showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896480?t=1769050369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896480?t=1769050369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896480/a54f1a005f654244c015751ff09ab83ee4af59e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769050369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896480/a54f1a005f654244c015751ff09ab83ee4af59e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769050369","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appi